    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d191-a6">

                <pb facs="0270" n="162" xml:id="pg162"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Exhibit D</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Commandery and Captaincy of Amapala,<lb/>Republic of
                                Honduras</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Amapala</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1893-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November 5, 1893</hi></date>. (Received 3 a.m., November
                        6.)</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the captain of the steamer Costa
                        Rica, present:</hi></p>
                <p>I am in receipt of a new order to demand of you the delivery of Don Policarpo
                    Bonilla, so I hope that you will execute it. If not, you will not be permitted
                    to weigh anchor, and if you should do so without first delivering him, you will
                    suffer the consequences of a bombardment for which you alone will be responsible
                    by reason of your refusal.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">B. Villela</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
